# Datasets, checkpoints, and run outputs.  Anchored to the repository root so
# they cannot match the `dataset/` package directory, and written without a
# trailing slash so they also match a symlink -- large datasets are routinely
# linked in rather than copied, and a trailing-slash pattern matches only real
# directories.
/data
/datasets
/2dgs
/checkpoints
/edits
/experiments
/results
/outputs
